{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21801","headline":"有鸟二十章 十五 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟皆百舌，舌端百啭声咄㗌。\n先春尽学百鸟啼，真僞不分听者悦。\n伶伦凤律乱宫商，盘木天鸡误时节。\n朝朝暮暮主人耳，桃李无言管弦咽。\n五月炎光朱火盛，阳焰烧阴幽响绝。\n安知不是卷舌星，化作刚刀一时截。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}